{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324760/extras/LOGO_86_small.png?t=1748559550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>FLORIDA INTERSTATE '86</strong>, a light-weight driving game where the goal is to cruise into the sunset for as long as possible while earning points by collecting cassette tapes and driving dangerously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324760/extras/fi86-steam-gif-4.gif?t=1748559550\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dynamic noon-sunset lighting system, a selection of colorful retro-styled sports cars and a synthwave/chillwave soundtrack ensure that every single one of your trips into this '80s fantasy Sunshine State is a unique one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324760/extras/fi86-steam-gif-3.gif?t=1748559550\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2324760?t=1748559550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324760/7e1503aa5ef1580ad1dc3bc0a0b13cf557d4f253/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748559550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748559550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2324760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748559550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript